840
01:12:46,415 --> 01:12:47,420
Não.

841
01:12:47,504 --> 01:12:48,505
Não.

842
01:12:52,161 --> 01:12:53,162
Dommer?

843
01:12:53,320 --> 01:12:54,321
Dommer?

844
01:13:54,522 --> 01:13:56,069
